{"skill":{"slug":"eastmoney","displayName":"Eastmoney"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1773775591931,"changelog":"eastmoney-hot-trend 0.1.0\n\n- Initial release registering the “东方财富” (Eastmoney) hot trend skill.\n- Supports retrieval and summarization of public market quotes, news, and bulletins.\n- Limits functionality to lightweight info extraction; no trading, bulk scraping, or reverse engineering.\n- Provides structured outputs for major Eastmoney pages—quotes, news, and trending sectors.\n- Includes automation guidance and compliance reminders on usage boundaries.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1518,"sha256":"60e31e5dc364869ac4dead60e24e0bd06a6e1e99c895dc77a7d7f96ed5594721","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1985,"sha256":"142a2f86d977a56389e4f24b2a431001875ff23e01b1614536e79d632f97cbcb","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789188574642,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"1352b91359fc2dd379d9f30d643a626075549ab51fb951bb4a0ea4bb93e0d76e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/1352b91359fc2dd379d9f30d643a626075549ab51fb951bb4a0ea4bb93e0d76e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780086187411},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":9,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789188574642},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a lightweight Eastmoney public information helper; its trigger is broad, but its instructions restrict use to public quote/news summaries and exclude trading or account actions.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Public web-page access, waiting for dynamic market data to load, and extracting visible fields are proportionate to the skill's stated quote/news-summary purpose. No local files, credentials, private sessions, or account stores are requested.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains only artifact/SKILL.md with Markdown instructions and metadata; there are no scripts, dependencies, install hooks, or executable components. The homepage field uses backticks, which appears to have confused one scanner's manifest parsing, but it does not add security-relevant behavior.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The frontmatter invocation says to call the skill for Eastmoney access or automation generally, which is broader than ideal for a financial site. The body narrows the scope to public pages, lightweight summaries, reminders, rate control, and non-trading use, so this is a guidance issue rather than a Review concern.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact does not request persistence, background workers, memory writes, privilege escalation, tool wrapping, credential handling, or cross-session behavior.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is public Eastmoney quote, news, announcement, and sector-trend summarization. The artifact explicitly excludes interface reverse engineering, bulk scraping, trading, and account-related operations.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, treat outputs as informational only and verify market data from authoritative sources before making financial decisions. The skill should be used for public Eastmoney quote/news summaries, not authenticated areas, trading, account management, bulk collection, or automated financial actions.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The concern about broad invocation text is supported by line 3, but the surrounding artifact provides clear limiting boundaries: public pages only, no trading/account operations, no interface calls, no bulk scraping, and rate control. I downgraded it to a non-blocking scope note.\n[AIG SARIF] expected: The AIG static scan reported no results, matching the artifact inspection: this is a single Markdown skill with no executable payload or persistence mechanism.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789188574642}}}}}